{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>On the third day.</b> Third is always harsh, for it is half of the square [four]. And this deed that Simeon and Levi did, their brothers knowingly did, for it is written \"with deceit,\" and \"the sons of Jacob\" are all of them. And Jacob's anger burned against Simeon and Levi, because they killed the men of Shechem."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:59.041167736Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}